      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISHAWAKA (6) had been super consistent recording two placings in a row before she was rewarded with a win last time, scoring at this track over 380m (21.79). Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Expected to be right there at the finish again. WONG GLASS (1) goes very well this course and distance starting 11 times for four wins and five minors. In the money last time at this track (22.25) in a Grade 4, finishing a 1.5 lengths third. Suited here and expected to run well. HARA'S NERO (3) boasts a strong record this journey with four wins and four minors from 12 tries. Hit the frame latest (22.09) when third at this track in a Grade 4. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. MISS ROSALEA (4) placed two back in a Grade 4/5 at this track then backed that up with a third (21.84) over 380m at this track last time.",
